It is morning in Copenhagen.
It is January, and it is very cold.
I have a warm jacket on.
Today is a big day.
It is a new start for me.
It is my first day at my new job.
I am walking on the street.
Where is the office?
I look at the large buildings.
The buildings have large numbers.
Here is number thirty-eight.
And here is number forty.
I walk a little further.
Here is number forty-two.
And there it is!
Here is number forty-four.
I see a large logo.
My new software company is right here.
I have a good feeling.
I am completely ready.
